# Redirects for the sciscend-home Worker (Cloudflare Workers static assets).
# /blog and /ivapopova have no trailing slash, so they fall outside the routes of
# the blog (sciscend.com/blog/*) and portfolio (sciscend.com/ivapopova/*) Workers
# and reach this one. Deeper paths such as /ivapopova/cv are inside the portfolio
# route; its Worker adds the slash itself (307).
/blog                /blog/                301
/ivapopova           /ivapopova/           301
